Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The mayor of Sydney
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}accepts the Olympic flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:05.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The crowd roars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:07.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He starts his speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Then someone whispers in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}his ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:12.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}Those are burning {\c&H006DDCFF&}underpants{\r}, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:15.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Australia, nineteen fifty-six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Some students bring their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.07,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}own {\c&H006DDCFF&}torch{\r} to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}relay. A chair leg,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:21.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a plum pudding tin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:23.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and someone's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.35,0:00:25.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}On paper it's furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:26.59,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}By smell it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}fucking emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}From the back row?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Absolutely the Olympics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The first prankster swings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.19,0:00:35.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The flaming shorts fly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}out. The Games haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}even opened and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}laundry's gone airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:44.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Somebody retrieves them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:44.97,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Barry gets the {\c&H006DDCFF&}torch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and runs in his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}tie. The cops give
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.65,0:00:49.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}him an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Well, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:52.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Can't leave formalwear alone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}with a live pair
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.37,0:00:54.81,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}of briefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:56.24,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Outside Town Hall the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}mayor grabs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.06,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The silver paint's still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}wet. Silver palm, smoking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:03.60,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}chair, thirty thousand people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:05.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A reasonable time to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}ask what the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.58,0:01:09.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He starts his speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Barry catches a {\c&H006DDCFF&}tram{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.30,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Then the real {\c&H006DDCFF&}torch{\r}bearer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.76,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}arrives. Imagine running across
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:16.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Sydney and finding out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}your applause already took
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}public transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Next morning Barry gets
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:22.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a standing ovation before
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}his {\c&H006DDCFF&}exam{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:25.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Turns out it's easier
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}to pass off a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}pudding tin than to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:30.15,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}pass a fucking test.
